  - Multi-user authentication with JWT
  - OAuth2 integration (Discord, Steam, Google)
  - VPN detection via ip-api.com
  - Discord bot and chat bridge
  - Landing page and admin dashboard
  - Scheduled commands
  - Item give lists
  - Multi-arch Docker support (amd64, arm64, arm/v7)

